# BizMate AI Design System (Version 1.0)

---

# Purpose

This document defines the official visual language of BizMate AI.

Every screen, component and future feature MUST follow this document.

If there is any conflict between generated UI and this document, this Design System takes precedence.

---

# Design Philosophy

BizMate AI should feel like:

• Professional
• Intelligent
• Friendly
• Fast
• Premium
• Clean
• Modern (2026)
• Trustworthy

The interface should reduce cognitive load.

Users should always know:

- Where they are
- What to do next
- What changed
- Whether an action succeeded or failed

The application must never feel cluttered.

Whitespace is part of the design.

---

# Design Inspiration

The overall quality should be comparable to:

- Stripe Dashboard
- Linear
- Notion
- Vercel
- Microsoft 365
- Slack
- Figma

Do NOT imitate any of these directly.

Use them only as quality benchmarks.

---

